flowchart LR
  EDGE[ALB and API ingress] --> TRACE[Correlation and trace context]
  TRACE --> API[FastAPI spans and structured logs]
  TRACE --> JOB[Queue and worker spans]
  TRACE --> GRAPH[LangGraph node and tool spans]
  TRACE --> RAG[Retrieval and citation metrics]
  TRACE --> MODEL[Model usage, latency, cost, outcome]
  TRACE --> REVIEW[Human review events]
  API --> OTEL[OpenTelemetry collector]
  JOB --> OTEL
  GRAPH --> OTEL
  RAG --> OTEL
  MODEL --> OTEL
  OTEL --> OBS[(Metrics, logs, and traces backend)]
  OBS --> DASH[Health, quality, cost, workflow, security dashboards]
  OBS --> ALERT[Actionable alerts and runbooks]

  API --> AUDIT[Append-only audit service]
  GRAPH --> AUDIT
  REVIEW --> AUDIT
  AUDIT --> ASTORE[(Durable integrity-verifiable audit store)]
  ASTORE --> INVESTIGATE[Authorized reconstruction and compliance views]

  EVAL[Evaluation results and release manifests] --> DASH
  CATALOG[Version catalog: graph, prompt, model, retrieval, rules] --> INVESTIGATE
  POLICY[Redaction, minimization, retention, access policy] -. governs .-> OTEL
  POLICY -. governs .-> ASTORE
